# @@TITLE@@

Invoke `@@TOOL_NAME@@` by name through NusaLLM `exec` or `exec_session`.
The executable accepts one JSON value as an optional argument or on stdin
(stdin is used when the argument is omitted). It writes one JSON result to
stdout, diagnostics to stderr, and exits with 0 on success, 2 for invalid
JSON input, or 1 for an unhandled runtime failure.

See the [usage reference](references/usage.md) for the implementation path,
resource directory, and example invocations.
